---
description: Data fetching with the typed SDK + React Query
globs: apps/web/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Data access
- Prefer a shared API client or SDK instead of duplicating request code across components.
- Avoid scattering hand-written calls to the same internal endpoints throughout the app.

# React Query
- Use stable, descriptive query keys.
- Keep fetch logic and query options organized instead of redefining them ad hoc in many components.
- Invalidate or refresh cached data deliberately after mutations.
- Set cache behavior based on the data type: market data can usually be slightly stale, portfolio or user-specific state often cannot.
